{"segs": ["PA_ja_170:0.4", "PA_ja_170:1.1", "PA_ja_170:1.2"], "en": "10. The Kakaṇṭaka Jātaka “This thorny plant does not grow up on the top of the gateway here before;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_170:1.3", "PA_ja_170:1.4"], "en": "“Mahosadha, find out why Kakaṇṭaka is so stubborn.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
